  'tp.hoard': 'Pit {p} holds {n} seeds. A pile of 12 or more goes round the board and can drop seeds all along the opponent\'s row for a big capture.',
  'tp.gaps': 'Your pits {list} hold 1–2 seeds: targets for the opponent. Add to them or move them.',
  'tp.winning': 'You are ahead. Don\'t chase captures; reduce your pits of 1–2 and give the opponent nothing to take.',
  'tp.losing': 'You are behind. Grow a pile of 12+ for one big capture, or leave the opponent pits of 1–2 to aim at.',
